{"id":25962,"author":"ViceTechnicolour","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.8px; font-weight: bold; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(0, 107, 210);\"\u003eMap Developer\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a rank that is granted to users who are outstanding in the community in the map sector of the server. This is a referred position, which means that users may not apply to get the rank. Contrary to what the moderation sector is, there is no trial process for this rank.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.8px; font-weight: bold; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(0, 107, 210);\"\u003eMap Developer\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a Staff Member that handles \u0026amp; appends the map repository, the map rotations, and almost everything related to maps. Map Developers keep the maps up to date and they accept/deny maps for testing once they're submitted by users to the forums. Map Developers add maps to the rotations if their gameplay is shown to be good after the testing. They may also create \u0026amp; remove new gamemodes to the server.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe following requirements must be met to be promoted:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Active in the map making community\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Able to successfully write, validate, \u0026amp; parse XML files\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Able to successfully use \u003ca href=\"http://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eGitHub \u003c/a\u003eto an intermediate extent\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Able to properly criticize and give feedback on maps\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Able to display teamwork and work together on projects\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Able to handle assignments \u0026amp; tasks given individually to you\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Able to speak understandable, coherent English\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Active in replying to map posts\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Ability to use \u003ca href=\"http://slack.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Link: http://slack.com\"\u003eSlack\u003c/a\u003e, our communication service\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Ability to use \u003ca href=\"https://atom.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Link: https://atom.io/\"\u003eAtom\u003c/a\u003e, or any other code writing tool\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Open Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Ability to use \u003ca href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/worldedit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Link: https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/worldedit\"\u003eWorldEdit\u003c/a\u003e, a multipurpose Minecraft tool\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eMore coming soon!\u003c/i\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.8px; font-weight: bold; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(0, 107, 210);\"\u003eMap Developer\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a rank that is granted to users who are outstanding in the community in the map sector of the server. This is a referred position, which means that users may not apply to get the rank. Contrary to what the moderation sector is, there is no trial process for this rank.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.8px; font-weight: bold